  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: TRADER ROTATION ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Trader rotation interval: {0} days -->
  <BTG_Settings_TraderRotationInterval>商人轮换周期：{0}天</BTG_Settings_TraderRotationInterval>
  <!-- EN: (vanilla) -->
  <BTG_Settings_Vanilla>（原版）</BTG_Settings_Vanilla>
  <!-- EN: (suggested) -->
  <BTG_Settings_BTGRecommended>（建议）</BTG_Settings_BTGRecommended>
  <!-- EN: (default) -->
  <BTG_Settings_Default>（默认）</BTG_Settings_Default>
  <!-- EN: How often orbital traders rotate at Traders Guild settlements. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc1>商会定居点的轨道贸易商多久轮换一次。</BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc1>
  <!-- EN: Lower values will give more variety, but less time to reach distant settlements. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc2>数值越低，商人种类越丰富，但赶到远处定居点的时间会更紧。</BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc2>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: CUSTOM LAYOUTS ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Use custom settlement map generator -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayouts>使用自定义定居点地图生成器</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayouts>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, Traders Guild settlements will generate with furnished, lived-in interiors. When disabled, they will use the vanilla layouts, or allow other mods' map generation to run.\nThe smuggler's den always uses its own map generator. -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsDesc>启用后，商会定居点生成时会带有布置齐全、充满生活气息的内部空间。禁用后，将使用原版布局，或交由其他模组的地图生成接管。\n走私巢穴始终使用其自身的地图生成器。</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsDesc>

  <!-- Yellow notes shown only while Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2's Traders Guild station is active -->
  <!-- EN: Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 is active: its Traders Guild station is generated instead, with some of this mod's additions layered on top. -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsVGE2Note>Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 已启用：将改为生成其商会空间站，并叠加了本模组的部分附加内容。</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsVGE2Note>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 is active: the settings below currently only affect the smuggler's den. Its Traders Guild stations keep vanilla garrisons and defeat rules for now. -->
  <BTG_Settings_DefendersVGE2Note>Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 已启用：以下设置目前仅影响走私巢穴。其商会空间站暂时仍沿用原版守备队与战败规则。</BTG_Settings_DefendersVGE2Note>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: CARGO VAULT ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Enable cargo vault access -->
  <BTG_Settings_EnableCargoVault>启用货物保险库访问</BTG_Settings_EnableCargoVault>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, each settlement's cargo vault hatch can be hacked to access trade inventory.\nWhen disabled, cargo vaults spawn sealed and inaccessible.\nOnly affects newly generated settlements, and requires the custom settlement map generator.\nThe smuggler's den vault is controlled by its quest reward instead of this setting. -->
  <BTG_Settings_EnableCargoVaultDesc>启用后，每个定居点的货物保险库舱门均可被骇入，以取用贸易库存。\n关闭后，货物保险库将以封闭状态生成且无法进入。\n仅影响新生成的定居点，且需要开启自定义定居点地图生成器。\n走私巢穴的保险库由其任务奖励控制，不受此设置影响。</BTG_Settings_EnableCargoVaultDesc>
  <!-- EN: Cargo vault stack limit: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxStacks>货物保险库堆叠上限：{0}</BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxStacks>
  <!-- EN: The maximum number of item stacks a cargo vault will contain when it is hacked open. The rest will stay in the settlement's trade inventory.\nLower this if a modded trader's vault slows or crashes the game. Slide fully right for no limit. -->
  <BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxStacksDesc>货物保险库被骇入后，库内最多可含的物品堆叠数。其余物品仍会留在定居点的贸易库存中。\n若某个模组商人的保险库导致游戏卡顿或崩溃，请调低此项。滑块拖到最右侧表示不设上限。</BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxStacksDesc>
  <!-- EN: Cargo vault wealth limit: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealth>货物保险库财富上限：{0}</BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealth>
  <!-- EN: {0} silver -->
  <BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealthValue>{0}白银</BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealthValue>
  <!-- EN: The maximum market value of the items a cargo vault will contain when it is hacked open. The rest will stay in the settlement's trade inventory.\nSlide fully right for no limit. -->
  <BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealthDesc>货物保险库被骇入后，库内物品的市场价值上限。其余物品仍会留在定居点的贸易库存中。\n滑块拖到最右侧表示不设上限。</BTG_Settings_CargoVaultMaxWealthDesc>
  <!-- EN: Unlimited -->
  <BTG_Settings_Unlimited>无限制</BTG_Settings_Unlimited>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: SENTRY DRONES ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Additional sentry drone presence: {0}% -->
  <BTG_Settings_SentryDronePresence>额外哨兵无人机数量：{0}%</BTG_Settings_SentryDronePresence>
  <!-- EN: Adjust the number of extra sentry drones on patrol. The number also grows with your colony's threat level. -->
  <BTG_Settings_SentryDroneDesc>调整额外巡逻哨兵无人机的数量。数量也会随你殖民地的威胁等级增加。</BTG_Settings_SentryDroneDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: DEFENDER GEAR ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Spacer-tech defenders (requires restart) -->
  <BTG_Settings_SpacerTierDefenders>太空时代科技守卫（需要重启游戏）</BTG_Settings_SpacerTierDefenders>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, Traders Guild defenders will carry spacer-tech weapons, armor and implants of better quality, and garrisons will include more elite fighters. When disabled, they will use vanilla equipment and the vanilla garrison mix.\nCitizens and children will have vacuum protection either way. -->
  <BTG_Settings_SpacerTierDefendersDesc>启用后，商会守卫会配备品质更好的太空时代武器、护甲和义体，守备队中也会有更多精英战士。禁用后，他们将使用原版装备和原版的守备队构成。\n无论是否启用，公民与儿童都会有真空防护。</BTG_Settings_SpacerTierDefendersDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: DEFENDER AI ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Entrenched defender AI -->
  <BTG_Settings_EntrenchedDefenders>固守型守卫AI</BTG_Settings_EntrenchedDefenders>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, defenders will stay inside their base to eat and rest, and will never assault or chase intruders into vacuum. When disabled, they will defend the base and then assault, as in vanilla.\nSettlement garrisons need the custom settlement map generator for this. The smuggler's den garrison does not.\nThis is decided when a map is generated, so it will only affect maps you enter afterwards. -->
  <BTG_Settings_EntrenchedDefendersDesc>启用后，守卫会留在基地内进食和休息，绝不会主动出击，也不会追击入侵者进入真空。禁用后，他们会像原版一样先防守基地，再发起进攻。\n定居点守备队需要开启自定义定居点地图生成器才会如此，走私巢穴守备队则不需要。\n该行为在地图生成时确定，因此只会影响此后进入的地图。</BTG_Settings_EntrenchedDefendersDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: DEFENDER THREAT POINTS ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Scale defenders to colony threat level -->
  <BTG_Settings_ScaleDefenders>守卫强度随殖民地威胁等级缩放</BTG_Settings_ScaleDefenders>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a settlement's starting garrison will grow with your colony's wealth and the difficulty, like raids do. It will never be weaker than the vanilla garrison. When disabled, every settlement will have a similar garrison no matter how far you have progressed.\nThe smuggler's den garrison is sized by its quest instead. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ScaleDefendersDesc>启用后，定居点的初始守备队会像袭击一样，随你殖民地的财富与难度而增强，但不会弱于原版守备队。禁用后，无论你的进度如何，每个定居点的守备队都大致相同。\n走私巢穴的守备队规模则由其任务决定。</BTG_Settings_ScaleDefendersDesc>
  <!-- EN: Defender strength multiplier: {0}x -->
  <BTG_Settings_ThreatMultiplier>守卫强度倍率：{0}x</BTG_Settings_ThreatMultiplier>
  <!-- EN: Higher values will give settlements more and stronger defenders when you first enter them.\nThe smuggler's den garrison is sized by its quest instead. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ThreatMultiplierDesc>数值越高，你初次进入时，定居点的守卫就会越多、越强。\n走私巢穴的守备队规模则由其任务决定。</BTG_Settings_ThreatMultiplierDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: GARRISON DEFEAT ========== -->
  <!-- 守备队 is Odyssey zh AncientGarrison.label (远古守备队); -->
  <!-- 炮塔 and 机械族 are Core zh turret/Mechanoid vocabulary. -->
  <!-- {0} = percentage -->
  <!-- EN: Garrison defeat threshold: {0}% -->
  <BTG_Settings_SecurityDefeatThreshold>守备队战败阈值：{0}%</BTG_Settings_SecurityDefeatThreshold>
  <!-- EN: The share of the original defenders that must be downed before the faction gives up a settlement or the smuggler's den.\nGuards and patrolling sentry drones count. Turrets and worker mechs do not.\nAt 100% they will fight to the last defender. -->
  <BTG_Settings_SecurityDefeatThresholdDesc>初始守卫中需有多大比例被打倒，派系才会放弃定居点或走私巢穴。\n驻守的守卫与巡逻的哨兵无人机计入，炮塔与工作机械族不计入。\n设为100%时，他们会战至最后一名守卫。</BTG_Settings_SecurityDefeatThresholdDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: LIFE SUPPORT ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Life support unit power output: {0}W -->
  <BTG_Settings_LifeSupportPower>生命维持单元电力输出：{0}W</BTG_Settings_LifeSupportPower>
  <!-- EN: The power produced by each life support unit.\nThis changes every life support unit, so it will affect all orbital platforms, not only Traders Guild settlements. -->
  <BTG_Settings_LifeSupportDesc>每个生命维持单元产生的电力。\n此项会修改所有生命维持单元，因此会影响所有轨道设施，而不仅限于商会定居点。</BTG_Settings_LifeSupportDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: QUEST WEIGHTS ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Trade request quest weight: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeight>贸易请求任务权重：{0}</BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeight>
  <!-- EN: How often the storyteller offers the guild's shuttle trade request quest, weighed against every other quest it could pick.\nSet to 0 to stop the quest being offered at all. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeightDesc>讲述者提供商会穿梭机贸易请求任务的频率，与其可选的其他所有任务共同加权决定。\n设为0可完全停止该任务的出现。</BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeightDesc>
  <!-- EN: Smuggler's den quest weight: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeight>走私巢穴任务权重：{0}</BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeight>
  <!-- EN: How often the storyteller offers the smuggler's den quest, weighed against every other quest it could pick.\nSet to 0 to stop the quest being offered at all. -->
  <BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeightDesc>讲述者提供走私巢穴任务的频率，与其可选的其他所有任务共同加权决定。\n设为0可完全停止该任务的出现。</BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeightDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: MOD NAME ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Better Traders Guild -->
  <BTG_Settings_ModName>强化商会</BTG_Settings_ModName>

  <!-- ========== DEFENDER RESUPPLY ========== -->
  <!-- EN: The garrison's distress call has drawn a response. -->
  <BTG_ResupplyDropArrived>驻军的求救信号得到了回应。</BTG_ResupplyDropArrived>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: DEFENDER RESUPPLY ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Resupply meals per defender: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefender>每名守卫的补给食物数量：{0}</BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefender>
  <!-- EN: The number of packaged survival meals delivered for each surviving defender when a starving garrison calls for resupply. Defenders will use a comms console to make the call once the food inside their base has run out.\nSet to 0 to disable resupply calls. Only one drop can land on a map every 6 hours.\nRequires entrenched defender AI. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefenderDesc>守备队饥饿并呼叫补给时，每名幸存守卫可获得多少份包装生存食物。守卫会在基地内的食物耗尽后使用通讯台发出呼叫。\n设为0可禁用补给呼叫。每张地图每6小时只会降落一次空投。\n需要固守型守卫AI。</BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefenderDesc>
  <!-- EN: Call in reinforcements -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaid>呼叫增援</BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaid>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a successful resupply call will also bring a drop pod raid from the garrison's faction to hunt your colonists. The raiders will attack freely instead of holding the base, and will sometimes land right on top of your colonists in a smaller group. This will only happen while the faction is hostile. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaidDesc>启用后，补给呼叫成功时，守备队所属派系还会派出一批乘运输舱降临的袭击者追杀你的殖民者。袭击者会主动进攻而不是留守基地，有时还会以更小的规模直接降落在你的殖民者头顶。仅在该派系处于敌对状态时才会发生。</BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaidDesc>

  <!-- ========== CARGO VAULT HATCH ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Relock cargo vault -->
  <BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockLabel>重新锁闭货物保险库</BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockLabel>
  <!-- EN: Relock the cargo vault. Its contents will be returned to the settlement's trade inventory. -->
  <BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockDesc>重新锁闭货物保险库。库内物品将返还至定居点的贸易库存。</BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockDesc>

  <!-- ========== SMUGGLER'S DEN QUEST ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Cargo claim: {0} -->
  <BTG_Reward_CargoClaim>货物提取权：{0}</BTG_Reward_CargoClaim>
  <!-- EN: Cargo claim: unknown manifest -->
  <BTG_Reward_CargoClaim_Unknown>货物提取权：未知货单</BTG_Reward_CargoClaim_Unknown>

  <!-- ========== ONE-TIME FIX NOTIFICATIONS ========== -->
  <!-- EN: {0}: Update -->
  <BTG_EmpireRelationFix_DialogTitle>{0}：更新</BTG_EmpireRelationFix_DialogTitle>
  <!-- EN: A bug in a previous version of {2} caused {0} to be permanently hostile when playing as {1}.\n\nThis has been corrected.\n\nWould you like to reset your relations with {0} to neutral, or remain hostile for now? -->
  <BTG_EmpireRelationFix_DialogBody>{2}旧版本中的一个漏洞，导致以{1}身份游戏时{0}会永久处于敌对状态。\n\n该问题现已修复。\n\n你希望将与{0}的关系重置为中立，还是暂时保持敌对？</BTG_EmpireRelationFix_DialogBody>
  <!-- EN: Reset to neutral -->
  <BTG_EmpireRelationFix_Neutral>重置为中立</BTG_EmpireRelationFix_Neutral>
  <!-- EN: Remain hostile for now -->
  <BTG_EmpireRelationFix_LeaveHostile>暂时保持敌对</BTG_EmpireRelationFix_LeaveHostile>

  <!-- ========== SCENARIO EDITOR: SCENARIO PARTS ========== -->
